cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use QRecoupling.jl, please cite the software (this record) and the article describing
  its cyclotomic framework (the preferred citation below).
type: software
title: "QRecoupling.jl: numerical and exact computation of classical and quantum recoupling coefficients"
abstract: >-
  A Julia package for numerical, exact and symbolic evaluation of classical and quantum
  recoupling coefficients (3j and 6j symbols, fusion and braiding data) and finite sums of
  factorial products, at q = 1, at unitary levels, at real or complex q, and as generic
  expressions in x = q + 1/q.
authors:
